1. This is an appeal from the judgment of our learned brother, Alladi Kuppuswami J, given in W. P. No. 5876/70 (
Buragadda Satyanarayana v. Income-tax Officer
) on February 1, 1972, whereby the learned judge allowed the writ petition and quashed the assessment order of the Income-tax Officer, dated September 28, 1968.
